    "combo1": {
      "title": "Endymion Magistus into the Full Fairy Tail Package",
      "description": "A hybrid line that builds the Magistus core off Spell Power Mastery before pivoting into a complete Fairy Tail package. Spell Power Mastery opens Regulus, the Prince of Endymion, which lands Endymion Empire and Verre, the Maid of Endymion; Verre Magic - Lacrima of Light and Witchcrafter Genni fuel Zoroa, the Magistus of Flame. Artemis, the Magistus Moon Maiden becomes Borreload Savage Dragon, then Spenta and Endymion, the Crescent Magistus feed Magistus Chorozo, Summon Sorceress and Akashic Magician, closing the Magistus half on Zoroa, the Magistus Verethragna. From there Fairy Tail - Luna and Matchgiru make Fairy Tail - Wiccat under Fairy Tail Ball, loading Once Upon a Fairy Tail and Tails of the Fairy Tails for Teller of Fairy Tails, a revived Fairy Tail - Snow and a second Wiccat, with Snow banishing the spent Magistus pieces to reset Once Upon a Fairy Tail.",
      "credits": "✨ Replay by Player Anonymous ✨",
      "date": "September 1, 2026",
